# Test suites are never imported at runtime by any service (each service's
# `app/` code only imports from `app.`/`shared.`/third-party - verified
# with a full-repo grep) - excluding them shrinks every build context
# upload and keeps them out of every image, on top of what the Dockerfile's
# per-service COPY (only `shared/` + one service's own directory) already
# narrows out for the other four services' code.
**/tests